{"seq":4,"slug":"embedded-bare-metal","title":"嵌入式裸机开发","stage":"DONE","category":"hardware-electronics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal","rating":{"composite":3.81,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.08,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introMarkdown":"# 嵌入式裸机开发\n\n嵌入式裸机开发是直接在硬件上编程、不依赖通用操作系统抽象的软件工程实践。开发者通过寄存器级操作控制微控制器（MCU）的每一个外设，获得确定性时序、极低延迟和最小资源占用。这种开发模式广泛应用于工业控制、汽车电子、医疗设备和物联网终端节点等对实时性和可靠性要求极高的领域。\n\n本知识库以 ARM Cortex-M 系列 MCU 为主线，从芯片架构原理出发，逐步覆盖外设驱动编程、实时操作系统基础，最终延伸至调试优化与固件安全。学习路径遵循\"理解硬件 → 驱动外设 → 引入调度 → 工程落地\"的递进逻辑，帮助建立从裸机到 RTOS 的完整嵌入式开发能力。\n\n现代嵌入式开发正经历从纯裸机向 RTOS 辅助的演进，但裸机编程能力仍是理解底层硬件行为的基石。掌握中断响应、存储器映射、时钟树配置等核心概念后，无论使用何种 RTOS 或 HAL 框架，都能快速定位性能瓶颈与硬件异常。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"microcontroller-fundamentals","title":"微控制器基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/microcontroller-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mcu-architecture-cortex-m","title":"MCU 架构与 ARM Cortex-M 内核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/microcontroller-fundamentals/mcu-architecture-cortex-m"},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-map-boot-process","title":"存储器映射与启动流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/microcontroller-fundamentals/memory-map-boot-process"},{"seq":3,"slug":"clock-system-power-management","title":"时钟系统与电源管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/microcontroller-fundamentals/clock-system-power-management"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"peripheral-programming","title":"外设编程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/peripheral-programming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gpio-interrupt-system","title":"GPIO 与中断系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/peripheral-programming/gpio-interrupt-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"timer-pwm-adc","title":"定时器、PWM 与 ADC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/peripheral-programming/timer-pwm-adc"},{"seq":3,"slug":"communication-interface-drivers","title":"通信接口驱动开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/peripheral-programming/communication-interface-drivers"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"rtos-basics","title":"RTOS 基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/rtos-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rtos-scheduling-principles","title":"RTOS 调度原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/rtos-basics/rtos-scheduling-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"task-management-synchronization","title":"任务管理与同步机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/rtos-basics/task-management-synchronization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"freertos-practice","title":"FreeRTOS 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/rtos-basics/freertos-practice"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"debugging-optimization","title":"调试与优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/debugging-optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"jtag-swd-debugging","title":"JTAG/SWD 调试原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/debugging-optimization/jtag-swd-debugging"},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-power-optimization","title":"性能分析与功耗优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/debugging-optimization/performance-power-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"firmware-security-ota","title":"固件安全与 OTA 更新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/debugging-optimization/firmware-security-ota"}]}]}